# Product rules

- 18 regular-season weekly picks; one NFL team per player per week; team must play that week; pick locks at that team’s kickoff; no regular-season team reuse.
- Eliminated players continue making weekly picks.
- Win = 1 point; loss or tie = 0.
- Missed pick is not a win, breaks streak, and eliminates from regular survivor.
- Bonuses: best record 4, longest streak 4, regular survivor winner 10; tied leaders each get the full bonus.
- One 18-0 player wins overall; multiple 18-0 players use playoff survivor as tiebreak.
- Playoffs are a separate survivor with a fresh used-team list; points 2 / 4 / 6 / 12 (max 24).
- Timezone: Central Time.
- Other players’ picks stay hidden until the relevant kickoff.
- Do not guess undefined cases (cancellations, postponements, exhausted playoff tiebreaks) — ask.
